ually review up to 2,000 invoices per day, proving to be too much to handle which could also cause errors. They partnered up with AWS Partner Morris \u0026amp; Opazo and Amazon Web Services (AWS) to help implement an generative AI-powered solution called Puerto X Monitor to automate invoice validation and reduce operational risk. The results featured a reduced need for large teams of industry experts as well as improved risk management and help to validate over 1 million invoices to date.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Bolsa%2070x70px.76067839998164b080aa56a6824908ffee5cb28d.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2025-01-23","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/partners/success/bolsa-de-productos-de-chile-morris-opazo/","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Video Testimonial","headline":"Breaking Barriers in FinTech: Generative AI Solutions Help Bolsa de Productos de Chile Optimizes Invoicing Processes"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#bedrock","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Bedrock","description":"Amazon Bedrock","dateCreated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language