venue, efficiency, and sustainability by building the Bosch Logistics Operating System (Bosch L.OS). Bosch L.OS is a global cloud-based service platform that facilitates easy, informed access to solutions from different partners.","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/bosch%20thumb%20innovator.219f897d53791310d136234ebf070211e8fcf55e.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Bosch-logo-200x70-1X.8e23ec5a9bde4ffd2cb444df9b50ccd1c160a0f6.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"bosch","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Automotive","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/supply-chain/bosch-cloud-platform-unlocks-operational-efficiencies-for-logistics-industry/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Bosch","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Bosch cloud platform unlocks operational efficiencies for logistics industry","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#strategic","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Strategic","description":"Strategic","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-04-02T00:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#blog-post","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Blog Post","description":"Blog Post","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:18+0000","dateUpdated":"