lth/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#ge-renewable-energy","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"ge-renewable-energy","dateCreated":"2022-01-08T04:32:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-03-02T02:48:48+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/aws-key-pages/homepage-key-pages/customer-stories-logo/GE.69d638be1bb211236c8d87590e8ee0be001b543c.jpg","descriptionSummary":"GE Renewable Energy modernized its Digital Services platform on AWS, achieving 99.9 percent availability and gaining the ability to scale without provisioning infrastructure.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/GEPower_Customer-Reference_Logo.7100af15f7461bdc2ea9edec4f9b61e536c54f48.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"ge renewable energy (gere)","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eAchieving 99.9% data availability to deliver carbon-free electricity\u003c/p\u003e\n","industry":"Power \u0026 Utilities","sortDate":"2022-01-07","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/ge-renewable-energy/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"GE Renewable Energy (GERE)","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","conte