chnology company that is at the forefront of using artificial intelligence and machine learning technologies to create personalised learning experiences that transform the way the world is educated.\nAlef Education provides AI-powered learning and teaching solutions that leverage real-time data to drive improvements across the education ecosystem.\nWith the power of AI, Alef Education aims to establish a holistic educational experience, from the moment students acquire new knowledge, to the step when the skills are reviewed and evaluated. The solutions Alef Education provides also target both high-performing students and at-risk students, leaving no student behind and catering to personalized needs.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/alef-education-logo%401x.f97256715032b5b00cd664b413a49e4b51214a2d.png","displayLocation":"Saudi Arabia","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2021-11-29","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/Dp3YAxFp-YM?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Alef Education: Building an Adaptive Learning System for K12 Students using AWS","customer-name":"Alef"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east-africa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","description":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Amazon Redshift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tag