 business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#ookla07072021lkjsfdoihjafw","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"ookla07072021lkjsfdoihjafw","dateCreated":"2022-05-23T21:42:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-23T21:53:03+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Learn how Ookla manages over 4,000 Speedtest reports they receive every second. Ookla\u0027s Data Pipeline on AWS allows for enriched reporting, data persistence and insights and analysis to share back with their customers. Josh and Marie discuss how Ookla\u0027s use of a Kinesis, Kinesis Firehose, and Athena overall allow for a partially serverless architecture to save time and money while processing large amounts of reports and data.","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2021-07-07","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/kHPGZOpbnok?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Ookla: Speedtest Intelligence Process 4,000 Reports/Second While Providing Near Real-time Insights","customer-name":"Ookla"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"G