. The company analyzes consumer attributes and event-level data including demographic data, purchase data, television viewership, location data, clickstream web events, and CRM data to form a 360-degree view of customer behavior. In this re:Invent 2019 session, Eric Whitney, global CTO at Annalect, dives into how the company cost-effectively processes more than 3 trillion events and analyzes petabytes of data using containers, Amazon Athena, and Amazon Redshift Spectrum.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/annalect-logo@1x.5a38c2aac614df3e9758f16d19006293016a91d2.png","displayLocation":"North America","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Digital Marketing","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/annalect-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Annalect Uses Containers and Amazon Redshift Spectrum to Cost-Effectively Process Trillions of Events","customer-name":"Annalect"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Amazon Redshift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","l