y Publicis Groupe, needed to process and analyze large amounts of data quickly in order to adjust advertising campaign and maximize return on investment. By using AWS, VivaKi can process more data simultaneously while reducing operating expenses by nearly 75 percent.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Vivaki_Customer-Reference_Logo.2fdfaee3fb381d9b1dd360935a22189d13a16c08.png","displayLocation":"France","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eVivaKi, a subsidiary of the french advertising company Publicis Groupe, needed to process and analyze large amounts of data quickly in order to adjust advertising campaign and maximize return on investment. By using AWS, VivaKi can process more data simultaneously while reducing operating expenses by nearly 75%\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/vivaki/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"VivaKi","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: VivaKi"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Amazon Redshift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#france","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"France","description":"France","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-