ill be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aws-case-study-sling-media","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-sling-media","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:57:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T19:06:13+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Sling Media provides video place-shifting products and services for consumers and TV service providers. Sling uses AWS to allow customers to seamlessly access video from their televisions on a variety of mobile devices, including PC/Mac, tablets and smartphones, no matter how many users are hitting the site.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/architecture-diagrams/customers/sling-logo.099301825f9c16b9ebe95a7eeb2a26e54563df42.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eSling Media provides video place-shifting products and services for consumers and TV service providers. Sling uses AWS to allow customers to seamlessly access video from their televisions on a variety of mobile devices, including PC/Mac, tablets and smartphones, no matter how many users are hitting the site. The company uses AWS to support large analytics volumes and data visualization and reporting.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/sling-media/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Sling Media","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: Sling Media"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Am